# What I created — Overview of the solution

A modular, secure, observability-first Enterprise AI Agent Platform that:

1. Accepts a business goal (natural language or structured).
2. Breaks the goal into discrete sub-tasks (planning).
3. Uses secure retrieval (vector DB + RBAC) to ground answers in enterprise documents.
4. Invokes specialized tools (ticketing, CI/CD, ERP, e-mail, search).
5. Produces explainable decision traces + human approval points for high-risk actions.
6. Logs all actions for audit, compliance, and metric collection.
7. Runs in Kubernetes for enterprise scalability and integrates with SSO, Secrets Manager, and SIEM.

Core components:

* Agent Orchestrator (FastAPI / gRPC service) — runs agent loops, manages state.
* Planner (LLM-based) — produces step plan.
* Executor (Tool adapters + safe sandbox) — executes steps, handles retries.
* Retriever (Vector DB + Synced indexer) — fetches relevant docs.
* Tool Connectors — Jira, Salesforce, Confluence, Slack, e-mail, SAP, internal APIs.
* Policy Engine — approval rules, risk scoring, redaction.
* Audit & Observability — structured traces, Prometheus metrics, ELK logs, distributed tracing.
* UI — dashboard for humans to review, approve, and inspect decision traces.
* Security & Governance — SSO (SAML/OIDC), Secrets Manager, encryption-at-rest & intransit, enterprise logging.

